description:
Job Description The Physician is responsible for providing quality healthcare care in coordination with the supervising Medical Director and in adherence to all applicable Federal and State Laws and Regulations. 
 Company Benefits 

 Company’s 401(k) Retirement Plan; 
 Paid time off per Company’s Policies; 
 Paid holidays off per Company’s Policies; 
 Health, dental, and life insurance per Company’s Policies; 
 Colonial Life Voluntary/Supplemental Benefits; and 
 Full access to America…
